[{"client_msg_id":"a9d945bd-80c5-4a9d-aeb9-89c00f85182d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Vim 自体を使ってゴニョゴニョできないかと試行錯誤してみている…かなり難易度が高い","ts":"1632926650.022100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kvx7l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5f3d785-80de-4d0e-a18e-039be58ec22c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そうですね","ts":"1632926488.021500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cBji"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ee79352-5974-4f99-a31e-99c5ab53c222","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"改行して出力されればいいわけでしょうか？","ts":"1632926442.021300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=uZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4da037d8-e18c-4493-9300-d66d83f58724","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"引数は複数あるので、分割する必要があります","ts":"1632917152.020900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CG0="}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ff76e5f-064b-42f1-afa3-0037a213b91a","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"引数を分割する がよくわからないです","ts":"1632917037.020500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u6MV"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"\u003c@U027UKB8YTW\u003e has left the channel","ts":"1632915103.020100","subtype":"channel_leave","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"\u003c@U027UKB8YTW\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1632915049.019700","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"\u003c@U02GD5GRJ72\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1632878903.019500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"eeb502ed-b6f0-462a-86ce-170a37a41bf9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"バッチファイルでも引数を分割するのがほぼほぼ不可能っぽいので、やはり Bash 限定かな…\nなお `executable('bash')` だけではダメで、`'shell'` やその周辺オプションが適切に設定されている必要があるのでかなり面倒","ts":"1632876317.019300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wru"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17f2c20b-293b-4e5a-a0b1-d9a2d743acbc","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"```let tempfile = tempname()\nlet cmd = tempname() . '.cmd'\ncall writefile(['@echo %*\u0026gt; \"' . tempfile . '\"'], cmd)\ncall system(printf('\"%s\" foo bar', cmd))\nechom 'args: ' . string(readfile(tempfile))```","ts":"1632854768.017500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"88FCf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3de68312-aa29-488c-913e-b3b81fe2f233","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"あとはバッチファイルを生成するとか","ts":"1632854049.017200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aHqc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87b04a26-0994-4017-b87d-ecb79594de8e","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"Windows でも bash 入ってればテストできるみたいな","ts":"1632853806.016600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ycg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1db473d6-8540-422d-94c3-e99f90f321d7","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"Windows というか `executable('bash')` チェックしてなければスキップみたいにすればいいのでは","ts":"1632853789.016300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qeN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97330db6-ceba-4242-86bf-fc2094dfa56f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Vim プラグインのテストで、`system()` で実行されるコマンドの引数についてテストがしたく、そのために `system()` に渡すコマンドの最初の部分(実行するコマンド部分)は入れ替えられるようにして、このコマンドをゴニョゴニョして渡される引数のテストができないか考えています。\nシェルが Bash の場合、\n```let tempfile = tempname()\nlet cmd = printf('dummy() { printf \"%%s\\n\" \"$@\" \u0026gt; %s; }; dummy', tempfile)```\nみたいな感じにして後で tempfile の中身を見たらいけたんですけど、Windows (cmd.exe) でどうしようか…と言うところで悩み中。いい案ある人いたら知恵を借りたいです。最悪 Windows でのテストはスキップかな…","ts":"1632849674.015400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y2WFq"}]}]
